WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.143
Find the operation connecting consecutive terms. Use the same step to extend the

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:06.664
sequence and justify it.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:15.909
Continue: 9, 17, 25, ... What is term 5? The answer is 41. Term 5 is 9 plus 4 times 8

00:00:15.909 --> 00:00:16.707
equals 41.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:23.537
The values 22, 29, 36 describe a pattern at a market stall. What is the value at step

00:00:23.537 --> 00:00:27.539
8 (counting the first as step 1)? Pause the video and think.

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:34.944
The values 22, 29, 36 describe a pattern at a market stall. What is the value at step

00:00:34.944 --> 00:00:41.887
8 (counting the first as step 1)? The answer is 71. Term 8 is 22 plus 7 times 7

00:00:41.887 --> 00:00:42.617
equals 71.
